WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:28.021
The next day Tom went to the picnic.

2
00:00:28.022 --> 00:01:17.902
He didn't bring Cat.

3
00:01:17.903 --> 00:01:21.131
Tom tried to play games.

4
00:01:21.132 --> 00:01:27.362
But he was still worried about Dirk.

5
00:01:27.363 --> 00:01:33.574
He got some food and sat down.

6
00:01:33.575 --> 00:01:36.442
Suddenly someone sat next to him.

7
00:01:36.443 --> 00:01:38.250
It was Ann!

8
00:01:38.251 --> 00:01:41.947
Tom dropped his plate in surprise.

9
00:01:41.948 --> 00:01:45.215
"I heard you were looking for me," Ann said.

10
00:01:45.216 --> 00:01:48.205
"I was at wizard school yesterday."

11
00:01:48.206 --> 00:01:51.650
Tom picked up his spilled food.

12
00:01:51.651 --> 00:01:55.413
"Why does Dirk hate me?" he asked.

13
00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:58.310
Ann looked sad.

14
00:01:58.311 --> 00:02:01.987
"My father is the head servant," she said.

15
00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:05.578
"But the royal wizard is much more powerful.

16
00:02:05.579 --> 00:02:08.444
This makes Father upset."

17
00:02:08.445 --> 00:02:12.117
"I've got a big problem," Tom said.

18
00:02:12.118 --> 00:02:16.347
He told Ann about Cat.

19
00:02:16.348 --> 00:02:20.316
"Dirk plans to tell everyone about Cat!"

20
00:02:20.317 --> 00:02:24.688
"Father did not like the last royal wizard either," Ann said.

21
00:02:24.689 --> 00:02:28.538
"That wizard put a bad spell on Father.

22
00:02:28.539 --> 00:02:31.822
He made him smell like a cat!

23
00:02:31.823 --> 00:02:35.185
So Father made the queen sneeze too!"

24
00:02:35.186 --> 00:02:37.423
Tom laughed.

25
00:02:37.424 --> 00:02:41.123
"Then the king learned of the spell," Ann said.

26
00:02:41.124 --> 00:02:46.099
"And he fired the royal wizard."

27
00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:50.012
"I'm going to get fired too," Tom said.

28
00:02:50.013 --> 00:02:52.523
"If Dirk tells the king and—"

29
00:02:52.524 --> 00:02:56.512
Ann suddenly jumped up and grabbed Tom's hand.

30
00:02:56.513 --> 00:02:59.658
"I just remembered something!" she said.

31
00:02:59.659 --> 00:03:05.156
"Come with me!"
